    {
      "id": "claim_6769afbacf48400dbf9936ac6b56d0b0",
      "statement": "A new request arriving at a cell in EnsuringDurability rescues it back to Resident and returns the eviction permit, because a leaked permit would count against max_evictions forever and eventually stand every future eviction down.",
